{"version":1,"id":"zach-bryan-heading-south","title":"Heading South","artist":"Zach Bryan","key":"Am","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/zach-bryan/heading-south/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Zach Bryan","chords":[{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":20,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":16,"beat":4},{"symbol":"B","column":19,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":20,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":16,"beat":4},{"symbol":"B","column":19,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"He was a boy who was a dreamer and he flew so high and proud","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"In a world full of people out to cut his young ass down","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"No one ever understood a single word he said","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"And they cast him to the wolves when he wasn’t well and fed","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"instrumental","text":"(              )","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":1},{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":2},{"symbol":"B","column":13,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"But boys we’ve got a riser, a riser in our midst","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"And he will get the last laugh if it’s the last thing he did","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And he used to roll around in that red dirt mud","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"But now he’s skipping town and that riser’s out for blood","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Don’t stop goin’, goin’ south","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Cuz’ they’ll let you play your music real damn loud","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Don’t stop headin’, headin’ south","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"They will understand the words that are pouring from your mouth","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"instrumental","text":"(              )","columns":16,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":4},{"symbol":"B","column":13,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"And that boy called his daddy to tell him what he did","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"That the masses screamed the lyrics of a messed up kid","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":43,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And then he told his old man he was never coming back","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"To be cut down again in a town like that","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And he surely came to learn people come to watch you fall","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"He's out to make a name and a fool out of 'em all","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"And they’ll never understand that boy and his kind","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Cuz’ all they comprehend is a fuckin' dollar sign","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Don’t stop goin’, goin’ south","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Cuz’ they’ll let you play your music real damn loud","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Don’t stop headin’, headin’ south","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"They will understand the words that are pouring from your mouth","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":41,"beat":2}]}]}